WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520
Di Renjie was a famous minister of Wu Zetian's time, renowned for being clever and capable.

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:10.646
Upright and fair in all he did, he was deeply loved by the people.

00:00:10.996 --> 00:00:17.596
When he handled cases he observed carefully, and he never wronged an innocent person.

00:00:17.946 --> 00:00:23.778
Many difficult cases, once they reached his hands, had their truth brought fully to light.

00:00:24.128 --> 00:00:27.560
The wrongly accused person finally returned home safely, to everyone's joy.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:33.166
Wu Zetian trusted him greatly and often asked his advice on the affairs of state.

00:00:33.516 --> 00:00:37.548
With him at court, everyone carried out their duties with greater peace of mind.

00:00:37.898 --> 00:00:44.330
Later, people wrote his stories into the 'Cases of Judge Di', which became a widely told legend.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:49.768
Whenever the teahouse storyteller told his tales, every seat was taken.

00:00:50.118 --> 00:00:55.158
Di Renjie became the representative figure of the wise and honest official in Chinese history.

00:00:55.508 --> 00:01:00.380
His wisdom and fairness are worth learning from for generations to come.

